se need not be consecutive. Verified for k ≤ 10.\n-/\ntheorem erdos_problem_141 :\n    ∀ k : ℕ, 3 ≤ k →\n    ∃ a d : ℕ, 0 < d ∧\n      (∀ i : ℕ, i < k → Nat.Prime (a + i * d)) ∧\n      (∀ i : ℕ, i + 1 < k →\n        ∀ p : ℕ, a + i * d < p → p < a + (i + 1) * d → ¬ Nat.Prime p) :=\n  sorry\n","numLines":23,"startLine":1,"totalLines":23}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bc65ef69-c81e-4e3f-8442-61d1175c8c31"}
